## Behavior

- GPG keys are group-level and are used to verify the signatures of Terraform provider versions uploaded to the Tharsis provider registry.
- `ascii_armor` is the ASCII-armored public key.
- A GPG key cannot be updated in place. Changing any attribute replaces the key.
- Uploading provider versions requires that a key has already been added to the group by an owner or deployer.

